{"type": "info", "prompt": "Split your Fhenix infographic into 6 SEPARATE infographics, one per quest post. Same style: dark navy, cyan accents, same fonts. Each one is 1080x1350 (4:5), with one idea, a big headline, and no more than 40 words of body text. Footer on all: \"Swanix • Building on Fhenix CoFHE\" + @fhenix. No two may share the same main visual.\n\n1) TRY GENESIS: \"I shielded on Genesis\". 3 steps: Connect → Shield → Send, plus Smooth / Surprised / Change boxes. Leave space for my real screenshot. Blur addresses and balances. (I'll give you my details after I use it.)\n\n2) GUY'S HOTTEST TAKE: \"Public ⇄ Private. Same token.\" Use only the Dual-Mode State Machine (State A Public vs State B Confidential, Shield ⇄ Unshield). Small quote box: \"The holder chooses.\"\n\n3) ALPHAENGINE: \"Trade without getting front-run\". Left: public mempool showing a visible order getting sandwiched. Right: AlphaEngine showing an encrypted intent with no sandwich. Use \"Cuts MEV sandwiches\", not \"eliminates\". Subtitle on one line: \"Private DeFi Execution\".\n\n4) OBOLOS: \"Compliant AND private\". Show a cap table with encrypted investor rows plus checkmarks for Accreditation, Jurisdiction and Cap limits, all checked without revealing holders.\n\n5) MAINNET CREATOR TAKE: \"Same Token. Same Pool.\" Legacy Privacy Silos (✗) vs Fhenix Dual-Mode (✓) comparison. Bottom stats: TFHE / Quantum-Resistant / 1 Token (not \"0x\"). Change \"view keys\" to \"permits\".\n\n6) BUILD WITH DUAL MODE: \"Unravix Proof\". Encrypted quiz grading: answer keys and scores stay private, and the student flips a credential public on demand. Tag it \"testnet\". No payroll.", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Fhenix Quest Infographics</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#0a0f2c;\n  --card:#16263d;\n  --accent:#00e5ff;\n  --accent2:#0066ff;\n  --ink:#f0f4f8;\n  --muted:#7a8ba1;\n}\nhtml,body{\n  margin:0;\n  width:1080px;\n  height:1350px;\n  overflow:hidden;\n  background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\nmain{\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  width:100%;\n  height:100%;\n  padding:68px;\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  gap:24px;\n}\n.grid{\n  flex:1;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows:repeat(3,1fr);\n  gap:24px;\n}\n.card{\n  background:var(--card);\n  border-radius:20px;\n  padding:24px;\n  display:flex;\n  flex-direction:column;\n  gap:16px;\n}\n.kicker{\n  font-size:24px;\n  letter-spacing:.12em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;\n  color:var(--accent);\n  font-weight:600;\n}\nh2{\n  font-size:48px;\n  line-height:1.05;\n  margin:0;\n  letter-spacing:-.02em;\n  font-weight:800;\n}\np{\n  margin:0;\n  font-size:28px;\n  line-height:1.35;\n  color:var(--muted);\n}\n.visual{\n  flex:1;\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  position:relative;\n}\nsvg{\n  max-width:100%;\n  height:auto;\n}\n.footer{\n  font-size:22px;\n  color:var(--muted);\n  text-align:center;\n}\n.box{\n  background:#1a2b45;\n  border:2px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius:8px;\n  padding:8px 12px;\n  font-size:20px;\n  color:var(--ink);\n}\n.quote{\n  border-left:4px solid var(--accent);\n  padding-left:12px;\n  font-style:italic;\n  color:var(--ink);\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <!-- 1) TRY GENESIS -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Try Genesis</div>\n      <h2>I shielded on Genesis</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"200\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n          <!-- Steps -->\n          <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"40\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Connect</text>\n          <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"100\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Shield</text>\n          <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"100\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"160\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Send</text>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n              <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L6,3 z\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\"/>\n            </marker>\n          </defs>\n          <!-- Boxes -->\n          <rect x=\"30\" y=\"150\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#1a2b45\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"55\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Smooth</text>\n          <rect x=\"85\" y=\"150\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#1a2b45\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Surprised</text>\n          <rect x=\"140\" y=\"150\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#1a2b45\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"165\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Change</text>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"box\" style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:8px;font-size:14px;\">Screenshot</div>\n      </div>\n      <p>Three‑step flow: connect wallet, shield assets, then send. Addresses and balances are blurred for privacy.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 2) GUY'S HOTTEST TAKE -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Guy's Hottest Take</div>\n      <h2>Public ⇄ Private. Same token.</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"200\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\">\n          <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"70\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Public</text>\n          <circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"100\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"130\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Confidential</text>\n          <path d=\"M110 80 Q120 70 130 80\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M90 120 Q80 130 70 120\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Shield</text>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Unshield</text>\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n              <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L6,3 z\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\"/>\n            </marker>\n          </defs>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"quote\" style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;right:8px;\">\n          “The holder chooses.”\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>Toggle between transparent and shielded states without moving tokens. One token, two modes.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3) ALPHAENGINE -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">AlphaEngine</div>\n      <h2>Trade without getting front‑run</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"380\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 180\">\n          <!-- Left: public mempool -->\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#1a2b45\"/>\n          <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">Public Mempool</text>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"150,66 150,74 158,70\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\"/>\n          <text x=\"90\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Order</text>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"150,106 150,114 158,110\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\"/>\n          <text x=\"90\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Sandwich</text>\n          <!-- Arrow to right -->\n          <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#right)\"/>\n          <!-- Right: AlphaEngine -->\n          <rect x=\"220\" y=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#1a2b45\"/>\n          <text x=\"300\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">AlphaEngine</text>\n          <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"80\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <text x=\"300\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">Encrypted Intent</text>\n          <text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\">Cuts MEV sandwiches</text>\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"right\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n              <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L6,3 z\" fill=\"var(--muted)\"/>\n            </marker>\n          </defs>\n        </svg>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);\">Private DeFi Execution</div>\n      </div>\n      <p>Public orders are visible and vulnerable. AlphaEngine hides intent, preventing sandwich attacks.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 4) OBOLOS -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Obolos</div>\n      <h2>Compliant AND private</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\">\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#1a2b45\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">Cap Table (Encrypted)</text>\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <text x=\"50\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Investor</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Accredited</text>\n          <text x=\"210\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Jurisdiction</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Cap Limit</text>\n          <!-- Row 1 -->\n          <text x=\"50\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">••••••••••</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"210\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <!-- Row 2 -->\n          <text x=\"50\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">••••••••••</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"210\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <!-- Row 3 -->\n          <text x=\"50\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">••••••••••</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"210\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">✓</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>Investor identities stay encrypted while all compliance checks—accreditation, jurisdiction, and cap—are verified.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 5) MAINNET CREATOR TAKE -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Mainnet Creator Take</div>\n      <h2>Same Token. Same Pool.</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"340\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 180\">\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"340\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#1a2b45\"/>\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">Privacy Comparison</text>\n          <!-- Columns -->\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Legacy Silos</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fhenix Dual‑Mode</text>\n          <!-- Rows -->\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✗</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✗</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>\n          <text x=\"80\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✗</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">✓</text>\n          <!-- Labels -->\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">View Keys → Permits</text>\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Single Token</text>\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same Pool</text>\n          <!-- Bottom stats -->\n          <text x=\"170\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TFHE • Quantum‑Resistant • 1 Token</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>Fhenix merges public and private pools, using permits instead of view keys, and stays quantum‑resistant.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 6) BUILD WITH DUAL MODE -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Build with Dual Mode</div>\n      <h2>Unravix Proof</h2>\n      <div class=\"visual\">\n        <svg width=\"300\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 180\">\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"300\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#1a2b45\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">Encrypted Quiz Grading</text>\n          <!-- Quiz sheet -->\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#0a0f2c\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Answers • Scores (encrypted)</text>\n          <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"140\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">🔓</text>\n          <text x=\"260\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">Public Credential</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"175\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent2)\">#testnet</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p>Students submit encrypted answers; the system grades privately. On demand, a public credential proves success.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <footer class=\"footer\">Swanix • Building on Fhenix CoFHE @fhenix</footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>", "size": [1080, 1350]}, "edits": [], "created": 1792675003.8935158}